// Local fork of bubbletea v1.3.10 that distinguishes Ctrl+Enter from Enter on
// Windows (upstream key_windows.go collapses VK_RETURN to KeyEnter regardless of
// modifiers). Used so the TUI can bind Enter=send and Ctrl+Enter=newline.
replace github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea => ./third_party/bubbletea
